{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>My son, if you have become a guarantor: you have struck your palms with a stranger</b> — To the stranger who is the lender you have struck your palms, to repay the debt. It is the snare in which you are caught: they are the words of your mouth."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:21:07.569607738Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}